{"name":"Inkwell Inception","hex":"#1e1e21","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"inkwell","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A container for ink, designed and usually positioned so that a person may conveniently dip a pen (such as a dip pen or quill pen) into it whenever a refill is needed.","A store of ink built into a pen, comprising a tube attached to the tip of the pen."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/inkwell"},{"term":"inception","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The creation or beginning of something; the establishment.","A layering, nesting, or recursion of something within itself. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/inception"}],"entries":[{"title":"Inkwell","blocks":[{"text":"An inkwell is a small jar or container, often made of glass, porcelain, silver, brass, or pewter, used for holding ink in a place convenient for the person who is writing. The artist or writer dips the brush, quill, or dip pen into the inkwell as needed or uses the inkwell as the source for filling the reservoir of a fountain pen. An inkwell usually has a lid to prevent contamination, evaporation, accidental spillage, and excessive exposure to air. A type known as the travelling inkwell was fitted with a secure screw lid so a traveller could carry a supply of ink in their luggage without the risk of leakage."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d5/Inkwell15.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inkwell","wikidata":"Q1160546"},{"title":"Inception","blocks":[{"text":"Inception is a 2010 science fiction heist film written and directed by Christopher Nolan, who also produced it with his wife Emma Thomas. The film stars Leonardo DiCaprio as a professional thief who steals information by infiltrating his targets' subconscious. He is offered a chance to have his criminal history erased as payment for implanting an idea into a target's subconscious. The ensemble cast includes Ken Watanabe, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Marion Cotillard, Elliot Page, Tom Hardy, Cillian Murphy, Tom Berenger, Dileep Rao, and Michael Caine."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/2e/Inception_%282010%29_theatrical_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inception","wikidata":"Q25188"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Inktpot_met_schroefdeksel_van_het_merk_Iridinoid_-_INDUS_V09588.JPG/250px-Inktpot_met_schroefdeksel_van_het_merk_Iridinoid_-_INDUS_V09588.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Inktpot_met_schroefdeksel_van_het_merk_Iridinoid_-_INDUS_V09588.JPG/500px-Inktpot_met_schroefdeksel_van_het_merk_Iridinoid_-_INDUS_V09588.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Inktpot_met_schroefdeksel_van_het_merk_Iridinoid_-_INDUS_V09588.JPG/250px-Inktpot_met_schroefdeksel_van_het_merk_Iridinoid_-_INDUS_V09588.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AInktpot_met_schroefdeksel_van_het_merk_Iridinoid_-_INDUS_V09588.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Inkhorn_and_ivory_case%2C_9th-13th_c%2C_exh._Benedictines_NG_Prague%2C_150683.jpg/330px-Inkhorn_and_ivory_case%2C_9th-13th_c%2C_exh._Benedictines_NG_Prague%2C_150683.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Inkhorn_and_ivory_case%2C_9th-13th_c%2C_exh._Benedictines_NG_Prague%2C_150683.jpg/960px-Inkhorn_and_ivory_case%2C_9th-13th_c%2C_exh._Benedictines_NG_Prague%2C_150683